#. L_CAVE_023
msgid "Flight Plans\n"
msgstr "Plans de vol\n"

#. L_CAVE_024
msgid "Picked up the flight plans.\n"
msgstr "Plans de vol obtenus.\n"

#. L_CAVE_025
msgid "Look out - it's an intruder...\n"
msgstr "Attention - un intrus...\n"

#. L_CAVE_026
msgid "Innocent civilians have been killed.\n"
msgstr "Civils innocents abattus.\n"

#. L_CAVE_027
msgid "Is he OK?\n"
msgstr "Va-t-il bien?\n"

#. L_CAVE_028
msgid "I'll go and get some help.\n"
msgstr "Je vais chercher de l'aide.\n"

#. L_CAVE_029
msgid "Good afternoon.\n"
msgstr "Bonjour. \n"

#. L_CAVE_030
msgid "OK, you know the way from here.\n"
msgstr "Vous connaissez le chemin.\n"

#. L_CAVE_031
msgid "You'll have to check that weapon in here.\n"
msgstr "Rangez votre arme, je vous prie. \n"

#. L_CAVE_032
msgid "Oh, my God!\n"
msgstr "...??? Oh, mon Dieu! \n"

#. L_CAVE_033
msgid "Weapons are not allowed in the base.\n"
msgstr "Les armes sont interdites dans la base. \n"

#. L_CAVE_034
msgid "Right, I'm calling security.\n"
msgstr "J'appelle la sécurité.\n"

#. L_CAVE_035
msgid "System shutdown initiated...\n"
msgstr "Coupure système initialisée... \n"

#. L_CAVE_036
msgid "Security systems have been shut down.\n"
msgstr "Systèmes sécurité coupés. \n"

#. L_CAVE_037
msgid "Weapons have been detected.\n"
msgstr "Armement détecté.\n"

#. L_CAVE_038
msgid "Suitcase has been deposited.\n"
msgstr "Valise déposée.\n"

#. L_CAVE_039
msgid "Suitcase has been scanned.\n"
msgstr "Valise scannée.\n"

#. L_CAVE_040
msgid "Hey, you - this is a restricted area.\n"
msgstr "Vous, là! Cette zone est interdite. \n"

#. L_CAVE_041
msgid "Are you new around here?\n"
msgstr "Vous êtes nouvelle ou quoi?\n"

#. L_CAVE_042
msgid "Hey - give me back my case.\n"
msgstr "Hé! Ma valise! \n"

#. L_CAVE_043
msgid "You get security - I'll deal with her...\n"
msgstr "Appelle la sécurité... Je m'occupe d'elle.\n"

#. L_CAVE_044
msgid "Upstairs...there's an intruder.\n"
msgstr "En haut...il y a un intrus.\n"

#. L_CAVE_045
msgid "Laser grid access denied.\n"
msgstr "Accès grilles laser refusé.\n"

#. L_CAVE_046
msgid "Laser grid system has been overloaded.\n"
msgstr "Système grilles laser: surcharge.\n"

#. L_CAVE_047
msgid "Too many neutral casualties inflicted.\n"
msgstr "Trop de cibles neutres abattues.\n"

#. L_CAVE_048
msgid "Stop them from getting the safe...\n"
msgstr "Empêchez-les d'avoir le coffre...\n"

#. L_CAVE_049
msgid "Disguise worn.\n"
msgstr "Costume revêtu.\n"

#. L_CAVE_050
msgid ""
"Now's your chance! Grab the stewardess's \n"
"bag and get her uniform.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vite! Attrapez le sac de l'hôtesse \n"
"et prenez son uniforme.\n"

#. L_CAVE_051
msgid "Use that case to conceal your equipment.\n"
msgstr "Utilisez cette caisse pour cacher votre équipement. \n"

#. L_CAVE_052
msgid "The case will get stopped unless you do something.\n"
msgstr "Cette caisse se fera arrêter si vous n'intervenez pas. \n"

#. L_CAVE_053
msgid ""
"So that's Air Force One? ... Huh, smaller \n"
"than I thought.\n"
msgstr ""
"C'est ça Air Force One, hein? ... C'est assez \n"
"petit en fait.\n"

#. L_CAVE_054
msgid "Stop them - they're breaking into the safe...\n"
msgstr "Arrêtez-les - ils ouvrent le coffre...\n"

#. L_CAVE_055
msgid ""
"Agent Dark in position. I can see the main entrance to the base, and I can "
"just make out the cable car arrival point.\n"
msgstr ""
"Agent Dark en position. Je vois l'entrée principale de la base. J'aperçois "
"aussi le point d'arrivée du téléphérique.\n"

#. L_CAVE_056
msgid ""
"Excellent, Joanna. That cable car is your way in... Our observer at the "
"lower terminus has spotted a member of the flight crew boarding a minute "
"ago. She is being escorted by air base troops. I don't have to remind you "
"that...\n"
msgstr ""
"Excellent, Joanna. Ce téléphérique est votre billet d'entrée. Notre contact "
"a repéré une hôtesse montant à bord il y a une minute. Elle est escortée par"
" des troupes de la base. Je n'ai pas besoin de vous rappeler qu...\n"

#. L_CAVE_057
msgid ""
"That they're probably innocent of any involvement in Trent's little scheme. "
"And I can't shoot them even if they shoot at me. What about the NSA "
"Agents?\n"
msgstr ""
"...qu'ils ne font pas partie de l'opération de Trent et que je ne dois pas "
"les abattre même sous leur feu. Et les agents de la NSA?\n"

#. L_CAVE_058
msgid ""
"I don't know how far the conspiracy has spread through the NSA, but I'm "
"willing to bet that the men Trent has around him here are loyal to him and "
"his plan. You have to get the evidence of Trent's betrayal onto Air Force "
"One and show it to the President.\n"
msgstr ""
"Je ne connais pas les implications de la NSA dans cette affaire. Je suis "
"néanmoins persuadé que les hommes de Trent lui sont tous loyaux. A vous de "
"trouver les preuves de la trahison de Trent une fois à bord et présentez-les"
" au Président.\n"

#. L_CAVE_059
msgid ""
"Yes, and protect him from his abductors. Do you have any idea what Trent's "
"plan might be yet, and what about those blonde guys?\n"
msgstr ""
"Et le protéger de ses ravisseurs. Avez-vous une théorie sur les plans de "
"Trent et sur ce type blond?\n"

#. L_CAVE_060
msgid ""
"Only vague suspicions, and I won't distract you with those. Good luck. "
"Carrington out.\n"
msgstr ""
"Que de vagues soupçons. Concentrez-vous plutôt sur la mission. Bonne chance."
" Carrington, terminé.\n"

#. L_CAVE_061
msgid "Lift inoperative - security system is active.\n"
msgstr "Ascenseur inactif - système sécurité actif.\n"

#. L_CAVE_062
msgid "Critical mission personnel disabled.\n"
msgstr "Personnel crucial inutilisable.\n"

#. L_CAVE_063
msgid "Critical mission object destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Objet crucial détruit.\n"

#. L_CAVE_064
msgid "Entrance to base secured.\n"
msgstr "Entrée de la base sécurisée.\n"

#. L_CAVE_065
msgid "We're taking over!!\n"
msgstr "On s'en charge!!\n"

#. L_CAVE_066
msgid "Hover trolley has been shut down.\n"
msgstr "Chariot coupé.\n"

#. L_CAVE_067
msgid "Equipment cannot be checked in.\n"
msgstr "Equipement ne peut être enregistré.\n"
